    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκανθ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of thorns, thorny</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.126
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ῥόδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					907a22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.5.3
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prickly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶττα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					503a2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				490b28
			</span></i>; of the vertebrae, <i>spinous</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				516b20
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				516b22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι ἀ</span>. <i>thorny</i>
			arguments, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				10.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			</div>
